{"message":"I checked your referral records. The referral dated 11/13/2025 for a Silver Rewards Card is still marked IN_PROGRESS, meaning the account was opened but the qualifying criteria have not yet been recorded as complete. For the Silver Rewards Card, the referred person must spend at least $750 within 60 days of opening; the $75 bonus typically posts within one to two billing cycles after that requirement is met.

You also have several referrals marked COMPLETE, including Bronze, Gold, Platinum, and Silver cards. COMPLETE means the referral met the bonus criteria and the bonus should be granted under the applicable card terms. I could not confirm a bonus transaction because there are currently no credit-card transaction records available for your account.

If you mean a different referral, please tell me the card type or referral date so I can narrow it down."}
